  "descriptionHtml": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Parabens</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A non-drying wood-clenched lip pencil with an ultra-blendable, fool-proof formula that makes enhancing your natural lip shape as effortless and comfortable as it looks.</p><p><strong><br>Formulation Type: </strong>Lip Liner</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Meadowfoam Oil: Hydrates and visibly revitalizes dry, cracked lips.</p><p>- Jojoba Seed Oil: Moisturizes and nourishes.</p><p>- Shea Butter: Is a vitamin E-rich ingredient that softens, smooths, and conditions.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, triclosan, </p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Following your natural lip shape, define and fill in using a sharpened tip.<br>-Smudge the outline with your finger.<br>-Finish with your favorite gloss or the Glossybounce&trade; High-Shine Hydrating Lip Gloss Oil (sold separately) for a SaieGlow&trade; look.<br><b><br>Recycling Instructions:<br></b>-Once you&rsquo;re finished with your liner, clean out the overcap.<br>-Toss what&rsquo;s left of the wood pencil. <br>-Recycle the clean overcap via Pact Collective.<br>-All Saie secondary cartons are made from 100 percent post-consumer waste and FSC-certified paper. Simply toss the carton in your home recycling bin.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Hydrogenated Jojoba Oil, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Limnanthes Alba (Meadowfoam) Seed Oil, Mica, Mangifera Indica (Mango) Seed Oil, Euphorbia Cerifera (Candelilla) Wax, Silica, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Macadamia Integrifolia Seed Oil, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax, Tocopherol, Ascorbyl Palmitate, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, May Contain: Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Manganese Violet (CI 77742)</div></details>",
  "description_html": "<div class=\"product-highlights\" style=\"margin-bottom:16px;\"><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Without Parabens</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Matte Finish</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Clean + Planet Aware</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Hydrating</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Fragrance Free</span><span style=\"display:inline-block;background:#f3f4f6;color:#1f2937;padding:3px 10px;border-radius:12px;font-size:12px;margin:2px 4px 2px 0;font-weight:500;\">✓ Cruelty-Free</span></div>\n<div class=\"product-description-main\" style=\"margin-bottom:20px;line-height:1.6;\"><p><strong>What it is: </strong>A non-drying wood-clenched lip pencil with an ultra-blendable, fool-proof formula that makes enhancing your natural lip shape as effortless and comfortable as it looks.</p><p><strong><br>Formulation Type: </strong>Lip Liner</p><p><strong><br>Highlighted Ingredients: <br></strong>- Meadowfoam Oil: Hydrates and visibly revitalizes dry, cracked lips.</p><p>- Jojoba Seed Oil: Moisturizes and nourishes.</p><p>- Shea Butter: Is a vitamin E-rich ingredient that softens, smooths, and conditions.</p><p><br></p><p><strong>Ingredient Callouts:</strong> Free of parabens, formaldehydes, formaldehyde-releasing agents, phthalates, mineral oil, retinyl palmitate, oxybenzone, coal tar, hydroquinone, sulfates SLS & SLES, triclocarban, triclosan, </p></div>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:16px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding-top:12px;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>How to Use</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;\"><b>Suggested Usage:<br></b>-Following your natural lip shape, define and fill in using a sharpened tip.<br>-Smudge the outline with your finger.<br>-Finish with your favorite gloss or the Glossybounce&trade; High-Shine Hydrating Lip Gloss Oil (sold separately) for a SaieGlow&trade; look.<br><b><br>Recycling Instructions:<br></b>-Once you&rsquo;re finished with your liner, clean out the overcap.<br>-Toss what&rsquo;s left of the wood pencil. <br>-Recycle the clean overcap via Pact Collective.<br>-All Saie secondary cartons are made from 100 percent post-consumer waste and FSC-certified paper. Simply toss the carton in your home recycling bin.</div></details>\n<details class=\"size-guide-accordion\" style=\"margin-top:12px;border-top:1px solid #e5e7eb;border-bottom:1px solid #e5e7eb;padding:12px 0;\"><summary style=\"font-weight:600;font-size:15px;cursor:pointer;padding:6px 0;outline:none;display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:center;\"><span>Ingredients</span><span style=\"font-size:18px;color:#6b7280;\">+</span></summary><div style=\"padding:12px 0 6px 0;line-height:1.6;color:#374151;font-size:13px;\">Hydrogenated Jojoba Oil, Caprylic/Capric Triglyceride, Limnanthes Alba (Meadowfoam) Seed Oil, Mica, Mangifera Indica (Mango) Seed Oil, Euphorbia Cerifera (Candelilla) Wax, Silica, Butyrospermum Parkii (Shea) Butter, Macadamia Integrifolia Seed Oil, Copernicia Cerifera (Carnauba) Wax, Tocopherol, Ascorbyl Palmitate, Helianthus Annuus (Sunflower) Seed Oil, May Contain: Titanium Dioxide (CI 77891), Iron Oxides (CI 77491, CI 77492, CI 77499), Manganese Violet (CI 77742)</div></details>",
